Chromium 156.0.8078.35 -> 156.0.8078.47, for the 156.0.8078.35 tree that
chromium-156.0.8078.12-to-156.0.8078.35.patch makes.

Generated from the upstream diffs between the tags (chromium/src
refs/tags/156.0.8078.35..156.0.8078.47, 118 commits) and the dependencies
whose DEPS revision changed (v8, third_party/devtools-frontend/src,
third_party/pdfium, third_party/dawn, third_party/skia, third_party/webrtc),
as served by Gitiles.

Left out, with the same rules as chromium-156.0.8078.12-to-156.0.8078.35.patch,
as they cannot affect a Linux build: files not in the release tarball (ios/,
most Android and test data), iOS/Android/ChromeOS/Mac/Windows-only files,
tests and docs, translations other than en-GB (Chromium's .xtb files and
DevTools' locale files), PGO/AFDO/orderfile pointers for other platforms,
submodule pointer updates. Everything else is kept, including files no build
target declares as an input.

Added: the tarball's generated files for the new commit
(build/util/LASTCHANGE{,.committime}, gpu/config/gpu_lists_version.h, commit
1d17a2e2ee147bb7d6ae2ab6abdb3a2510c17775, refs/branch-heads/8078@{#1313}).

Checked: applies after chromium-156.0.8078.12-to-156.0.8078.35.patch;
chrome/VERSION becomes 156.0.8078.47; a random sample of 39 patched files
(among them some of each dependency) is byte-identical to the 156.0.8078.47
versions.

