+    limit reached: no attachment slots were left. Fresh content required, tab
+    not live: the tab needed freshly extracted content (e.g. Incognito) but its
+    renderer was not live (e.g. frozen or discarded). Cache unavailable, tab not
+    live: a background tab had neither cached page content nor a live renderer.
